flowchart TB
  User[Users] --> DNS[Route 53 weighted DNS]
  DNS --> CF[CloudFront\nACM]
  CF --> ALB1[ALB node\nprimary public subnet]
  CF --> ALB2[ALB node\nsecondary public subnet]
  ALB1 --> Pod[One EKS worker +\nlegacy Next.js pod\nprimary private subnet]
  ALB2 -->|cross-zone forwarding| Pod
  Pod --> NAT[One NAT gateway\nprimary public subnet]
  Pod --> Secret[One Secrets Manager secret]
  Pod --> Providers[Supabase · Alpaca · Yahoo · Gemini]
  GitHub[GitHub Actions] --> OIDC[OIDC role]
  OIDC --> ECR[ECR immutable image]
  ECR --> GitOps[Digest promotion PR]
  GitOps --> Argo[Argo CD]
  Argo --> Pod
  Vercel[Vercel rollback origin] -. weighted rollback .-> DNS

